#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-offloader-setup.md:377
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "개요"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-offloader-setup.md:20
msgid ""
"The calls-offloader service is a dedicated microservice that handles "
"resource-intensive tasks for Mattermost Calls, including:"
msgstr "calls-offloader 서비스는 OKR.BEST 통화(Calls)의 리소스 집약적인 작업을 처리하는 전용 마이크로서비스이며, 다음을 포함합니다:"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-offloader-setup.md:22
msgid "**Call recording**: Captures audio and screen sharing content from calls"
msgstr "**통화 녹화**: 통화에서 오디오 및 화면 공유 콘텐츠를 캡처합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-offloader-setup.md:23
msgid "**Call transcription**: Provides automated transcription of recorded calls"
msgstr "**통화 전사**: 녹화된 통화의 자동 전사를 제공합니다"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-offloader-setup.md:24
msgid ""
"**Live captions** (Experimental): Real-time transcription during active "
"calls"
msgstr "**라이브 캡션**(실험적): 활성 통화 중 실시간 전사"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-offloader-setup.md:26
msgid ""
"By offloading these tasks to a dedicated service, the main Mattermost "
"server and RTCD service can focus on core functionality while maintaining"
" optimal performance."
msgstr "이러한 작업을 전용 서비스로 오프로드함으로써, 기본 OKR.BEST 서버와 RTCD 서비스는 최적의 성능을 유지하면서 핵심 기능에 집중할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-offloader-setup.md:28
#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-offloader-setup.md:386
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "사전 요구 사항"

