msgstr "calls-offloader를 배포하기 전에, 다음을 갖추었는지 확인하세요:"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-offloader-setup.md:32
msgid "A Mattermost Enterprise license"
msgstr "Mattermost Enterprise 라이선스"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-offloader-setup.md:33
msgid ""
"A properly configured Mattermost Calls deployment (either integrated or "
"with RTCD)"
msgstr "올바르게 구성된 OKR.BEST 통화(Calls) 배포(통합 또는 RTCD 사용)"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-offloader-setup.md:34
msgid "A moderately powerful server with Docker installed and running"
msgstr "Docker가 설치되어 실행 중인 적당히 강력한 서버"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-offloader-setup.md:35
msgid ""
"Sufficient storage space for recordings (see [Storage Requirements"
"](#storage-requirements))"
msgstr "녹화를 위한 충분한 저장 공간(참조 [저장소 요구 사항](#storage-requirements))"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-offloader-setup.md:37
msgid "System Requirements"
msgstr "시스템 요구 사항"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-offloader-setup.md:39
msgid ""
"For detailed system requirements and performance recommendations, refer "
"to the [calls-offloader performance "
"documentation](https://github.com/mattermost/calls-"
"offloader/blob/master/docs/performance.md)."
msgstr "자세한 시스템 요구 사항 및 성능 권장 사항은 [calls-offloader 성능 문서](https://github.com/mattermost/calls-offloader/blob/master/docs/performance.md)를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-offloader-setup.md:41
msgid "Storage Requirements"
msgstr "저장소 요구 사항"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-offloader-setup.md:43
msgid ""
"Call recordings can consume significant storage space. Based on average "
"recording sizes with screen sharing on (including one audio track), "
"storage usage by quality chosen is approximately:"
msgstr "통화 녹화는 상당한 저장 공간을 소비할 수 있습니다. 화면 공유가 켜진 상태(오디오 트랙 1개 포함)의 평균 녹화 크기를 기준으로, 선택한 품질별 저장소 사용량은 대략 다음과 같습니다:"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-offloader-setup.md:45
msgid "**Low**: ~0.5GB/hour (or ~8MB/minute)"
msgstr "**낮음**: 시간당 ~0.5GB(또는 분당 ~8MB)"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-offloader-setup.md:46
msgid "**Medium**: ~0.7GB/hour (or ~12MB/minute)"
msgstr "**중간**: 시간당 ~0.7GB(또는 분당 ~12MB)"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-offloader-setup.md:47
msgid "**High**: ~1.2GB/hour (or ~20MB/minute)"
msgstr "**높음**: 시간당 ~1.2GB(또는 분당 ~20MB)"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-offloader-setup.md:49
msgid ""
"*Note: Audio-only recordings consume approximately 1MB per minute per "
"participant.*"
msgstr "*참고: 오디오 전용 녹화는 참가자당 분당 약 1MB를 소비합니다.*"

