msgstr "**security.admin_secret_key**: 관리자 인증을 위한 비밀 키(기본값에서 변경하세요!)"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-offloader-setup.md:157
msgid "Store Configuration"
msgstr "스토어 구성"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-offloader-setup.md:159
msgid "Controls persistent data storage:"
msgstr "영구 데이터 저장을 제어합니다:"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-offloader-setup.md:161
msgid ""
"**data_source**: Path to directory for storing client (i.e., connecting "
"Mattermost nodes) IDs and credentials"
msgstr "**data_source**: 클라이언트(즉, 연결하는 OKR.BEST 노드) ID 및 자격 증명을 저장하기 위한 디렉토리 경로"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-offloader-setup.md:163
msgid "Jobs Configuration"
msgstr "작업 구성"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-offloader-setup.md:165
msgid "Controls job processing behavior:"
msgstr "작업 처리 동작을 제어합니다:"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-offloader-setup.md:167
msgid "**api_type**: Job execution backend (`docker` or `kubernetes`)"
msgstr "**api_type**: 작업 실행 백엔드(`docker` 또는 `kubernetes`)"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-offloader-setup.md:168
msgid ""
"**max_concurrent_jobs**: Maximum number of simultaneous "
