msgstr "**max_concurrent_jobs**: 동시 녹화/전사 작업의 최대 수"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-offloader-setup.md:169
msgid ""
"**failed_jobs_retention_time**: How long to keep failed job data before "
