#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-offloader-setup.md:469
msgid ""
"In air-gapped environments the recorder and transcriber containers "
"typically need to reach the Mattermost server via an internal URL. Set "
"the following environment variables on the **Mattermost server** to "
"override the site URL used by spawned jobs:"
msgstr "에어갭 환경에서는 녹화 및 전사 컨테이너가 일반적으로 내부 URL을 통해 OKR.BEST 서버에 도달해야 합니다. **OKR.BEST 서버**에서 다음 환경 변수를 설정하여 생성된 작업이 사용하는 사이트 URL을 재정의합니다:"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-offloader-setup.md:476
msgid ""
"You may also need to add the internal URL to "
"[`ServiceSettings.AllowCorsFrom`](https://docs.mattermost.com/configure"
"/integrations-configuration-settings.html#enable-cross-origin-requests-"
"from) in the Mattermost server configuration."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 서버 구성에서 [`ServiceSettings.AllowCorsFrom`](https://docs.mattermost.com/configure/integrations-configuration-settings.html#enable-cross-origin-requests-from)에 내부 URL을 추가해야 할 수도 있습니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/calls-offloader-setup.md:478
msgid ""
"[!NOTE] In particularly restrictive environments (e.g., VMs with strict "
"network isolation), set `DOCKER_NETWORK=host` in the `calls-offloader` "
"service environment so that job containers can reach the Mattermost "
"server via its local address."
msgstr "[!NOTE] 특히 제한적인 환경(예: 엄격한 네트워크 격리가 있는 VM)에서는, 작업 컨테이너가 로컬 주소를 통해 OKR.BEST 서버에 도달할 수 있도록 `calls-offloader` 서비스 환경에서 `DOCKER_NETWORK=host`를 설정합니다."

